third quarter of 2019 and included $600,000 in restructuring charges, primarily related to the early buyout of our Chicago office, which had a 2024 termination.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/omega-healthcare-investors-inc-ohi-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"OHI 2020 Q1","e":"ohi","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ms. Michele Reber","x":"…forward-looking statements, such as statements regarding our financial projections, dividend policy, portfolio restructuring, rent payments, financial condition or prospects of our operators, contemplated acquisitions, dispositions or transitions and our business and portfolio outlook generally.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/omega-healthcare-investors-inc-ohi-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"OHI 2020 Q1","e":"ohi","d":"2020-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"C. Taylor Pickett","x":"Nevertheless, we've withdrawn our 2020 guidance in recognition of the significant COVID-19-driven uncertainty that we face for the remainder of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/omega-healthcare-investors-inc-ohi-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"OHI 2020 Q3","e":"ohi","d":"2020-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michele Reber","x":"…forward-looking statements, such as statements regarding our financial projections, dividend policy, portfolio restructuring, rent payments, financial condition or prospects of our operators, contemplated acquisitions, dispositions or transitions, and our business and portfolio outlook generally.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/31/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2021 Q2","e":"ohi","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michele Reber","x":"…Forward-Looking Statements, such as statements regarding our financial projections, dividend policy, portfolio restructuring, rent payments, financial condition or prospects of