-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Taylor Pickett","x":"The Gulf Coast portfolio net proceeds of over $300 million offset the lost Gulf Coast contractual revenue, while Guardian, which is still in process, will result in a very modest diminution in value from the pre-restructuring contractual rents and no diminution in value from our origination yields.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q1-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2022 Q2","e":"ohi","d":"2022-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Taylor Pickett","x":"As we discussed last quarter, the ability to put restructuring portfolios back to work improved the FAD payout ratio by 7%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/02/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q2-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2022 Q2","e":"ohi","d":"2022-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Taylor Pickett","x":"We've completed all of the restructuring work related to Gulf Coast.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/02/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q2-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2022 Q3","e":"ohi","d":"2022-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Taylor Pickett","x":"The most recent example of our successful restructuring work is the sale of 21 Agemo assets, generating gross proceeds of $359 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q3-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2022 Q3","e":"ohi","d":"2022-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Taylor Pickett","x":"Early in 2023, we expect Agemo to begin paying rent and interest on the balance of the 29 facilities that they retained in the restructuring and anticipate the rent and interest on the Agemo retained portfolio will add nearly $0.03 per share to quarterly FAD.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q3-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2022 Q4","e":"ohi","d":"2023-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Taylor Pickett","x":"Later, Dan will review some of our new and ongoing restructuring activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q4-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2022 Q4","e":"ohi","d":"2023-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dan Booth","x":"The restructuring of Agemo concluded in the fourth quarter of 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q4-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2023 Q1","e":"ohi","d":"2023-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Taylor Pickett","x":"These completed restructurings, along with progress related to the LaVie restructuring, provide us with strong FAD momentum in the next few quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q1-2023-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2023 Q1","e":"ohi","d":"2023-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bob Stephenson","x":"It's worth noting this $0.02 decrease doesn't factor in the final LaVie restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q1-2023-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2023 Q2","e":"ohi","d":"2023-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michele Reber","x":"…facts may be forward-looking statements such as statements regarding our financial projections, dividend policy, portfolio restructuring, rent payments, financial condition or prospects of our operators, contemplated dispositions or transitions, and our business and portfolio outlook generally.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q2-2023-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2023 Q2","e":"ohi","d":"2023-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Taylor Pickett","x":"When the LaVie restructuring is completed, we expect a significant increase in cash rents from the current agreed upon partial rent payments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q2-2023-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2023 Q3","e":"ohi","d":"2023-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dan Booth","x":"As previously discussed, Omega and LaVie have continued our process of restructuring their portfolio by transitioning certain underperforming facilities, mostly located in the state of Florida.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q3-2023-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2023 Q3","e":"ohi","d":"2023-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dan Booth","x":"On Omega's first quarter 2022 earnings call, Omega announced that we had entered into a restructuring agreement with Guardian Healthcare after agreeing to sell 12 facilities, eight in Pennsylvania and four in Ohio, and successfully releasing eight facilities, all located in Pennsylvania.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q3-2023-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2023 Q4","e":"ohi","d":"2024-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bob Stephenson","x":"We returned to happily so our adjusted FFO guidance based on historical practices and gave a little bit wider range because we did mention we have LaVie and Guardian in the transition restructuring mode and Maplewood needs to return to paying full contractual rent.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/08/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q4-2023-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2023 Q4","e":"ohi","d":"2024-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dan Booth","x":"We are still working through the restructuring will be, so we haven't determined exactly what the actual rent will be when that's all shaped out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/08/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q4-2023-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2024 Q1","e":"ohi","d":"2024-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bob Stephenson","x":"We're assuming LaVie continues to pay at the existing rate of $1.5 million per month until completion of the portfolio restructuring and continued improvement in Maplewood's ability to pay contractual rent.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q1-2024-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2024 Q1","e":"ohi","d":"2024-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dan Booth","x":"This concludes our restructuring of our Guardian portfolio and our relationship overall.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/03/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q1-2024-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2024 Q2","e":"ohi","d":"2024-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Taylor C. Pickett","x":"And then there's a handful of smaller operators that are -- we're currently working for some restructuring activity and I think sell-side of the bucket.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/02/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q2-2024-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2024 Q3","e":"ohi","d":"2024-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel J. Booth","x":"As of today, Omega is currently not engaged in any restructuring activity with any of its material operators, the one exception being LaVie, which will be seeking confirmation of its plan of reorganization in mid-November.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/31/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q3-2024-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2024 Q3","e":"ohi","d":"2024-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Taylor C. Pickett","x":"We're done with the financial restructuring there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/31/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q3-2024-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2024 Q4","e":"ohi","d":"2025-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vikas Gupta","x":"As of today, the only major operator, Omega is engaged in restructuring activity with is Levi.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/06/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q4-2024-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2024 Q4","e":"ohi","d":"2025-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Carroll","x":"But are any buyers or sellers acting differently today, specifically for the US properties, just given the volatility we've seen in interest rates and the political environment discussing potential, I guess, Medicaid restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/06/omega-healthcare-investors-ohi-q4-2024-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"OHI 2025 Q2","e":"ohi","d":"2025-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vikas Gupta","x":"Other than Genesis, Omega is currently not engaged in restructuring activity with any of our major operators.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/omega-healthcare-ohi-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OHI 2025 Q2","e":"ohi","d":"2025-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Nick Yulico","x":"Just maybe remind us why you have confidence that the pool of assets you know, you own with them is still assets they want to keep and that there's not, you know, risk of some sort of, you know, rejection, of lease or, you know, any sort of move to rightsize rent through a bankruptcy process?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/omega-healthcare-ohi-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OHI 2025 Q3","e":"ohi","d":"2025-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vikas Gupta","x":"Or in addition to the 64 joint venture facilities Sabre operates 51 additional facilities owned by us and leased under a consolidated triple net pass-through lease.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/31/omega-healthcare-ohi-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OHI 2025 Q3","e":"ohi","d":"2025-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan M. Krull","x":"We also look forward to the potential for regulatory changes signaled by the request for information in the skilled nursing proposed payment rule earlier this year, on ways to streamline regulations and reduce administrative burdens.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/31/omega-healthcare-ohi-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OHI 2025 Q3","e":"ohi","d":"2025-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Omotayo Okusanya","x":"Wanted to go back to some of Megan's commentary just around CMS initiatives, looking for input into how to streamline regulation within the skilled nurse industry, Just kinda curious what suggestions Omega may be making, what suggestions the industry as a whole may be making.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/31/omega-healthcare-ohi-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OHI 2026 Q1","e":"ohi","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Megan M. Krull","x":"On a separate note, over the last year or so, Medicare Advantage has come under scrutiny due to allegations of upcoding, high denial rates, delayed payments, and cost savings not keeping pace with expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/omega-healthcare-ohi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OHI 2026 Q1","e":"ohi","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew P. Gourmand","x":"Obviously, we would be less reluctant to take a swing at things where there is a cost saving that we know a better manager can operate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/omega-healthcare-ohi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[34,1,7159,0,0,0,3125,3293],[35,1,4293,0,0,0,3215,717],[36,1,5690,0,0,0,4486,915],[37,1,6589,0,0,0,4872,1281],[38,1,6424,0,0,0,4686,1345],[39,1,7340,0,0,0,5105,1762],[40,1,8329,0,0,0,5921,1868],[41,1,8986,0,0,0,6774,1783],[42,1,7000,0,0,0,5296,1351],[43,1,8633,0,0,0,6294,1924],[44,1,9984,0,0,0,7085,2389],[45,1,6770,0,0,0,4963,1431],[46,1,6745,0,0,0,5242,1132],[47,1,5494,0,0,0,4640,567],[48,1,7071,0,0,0,4786,1868],[49,1,7581,0,0,0,5425,1682],[50,1,84